<title>UK: UK stocks rise 674 million stg in fourth quarter.</title>
<headline>UK stocks rise 674 million stg in fourth quarter.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The level of stocks in the UK production, construction and distribution industries rose by 674 million stg in the fourth quarter, the Office for National Statistics said on Monday.</p>
<p>Following is a breakdown of UK stocks (seasonally adjusted in millions stg) --</p>
<p>			  Q4 1996	   Q3 1996	    Q4 1995</p>
<p> Total		    674		-897		  823</p>
<p> Mining &amp; quarrying   -67		 -69		  -22</p>
<p> Manufacturing	  307		-228		  562</p>
<p> Elec, gas &amp; water     56		 -37		  -26</p>
<p> Construction	    91		-182		 -154</p>
<p> Motor trades	   144		 122		  226</p>
<p> Wholesaling	    -34		-362		   29</p>
<p> Retailing		177		-141		  208</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
